OL,3,ANew draft deal aims to avert collapse
OL,4,Aof talks at COP31 climate summit
OL,5,
OL,6,FEfforts to avert the collapse of talks
OL,7,Fat the UN COP31 summit have faced
OL,8,Ffurther delays on the second day of
OL,9,Fovertime, as countries struggle to
OL,10,Freach a new global climate deal.
OL,12,FA new draft agreement was published in
OL,13,Fthe early hours of Sunday which the
OL,14,FTurkey and Australia co-hosts hoped
OL,15,Fwould bridge the divide between
OL,16,Fnations.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
