OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANew draft deal aims to avert collapse
OL,4,Aof talks at COP31 climate summit
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough it still includes no specific
OL,7,Freference to "transitioning away from
OL,8,Ffossil fuels" - an omission in the
OL,9,Fprevious draft that sparked threats of
OL,10,Fwalkouts - it does acknowledge a
OL,11,Fprevious commitment made by countries
OL,12,Fto do just that three years ago.
OL,14,FCountries were expected to reconvene to
OL,15,Fdecide whether to approve a new deal,
OL,16,Fbut that meeting was delayed on Sunday
OL,17,Fmorning.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
